    "regime_notes": "60D IC remained positive in 2024 (0.382359; 92 dates), 2027-2029 (0.158737; 782 dates), 2030 (0.310194; 261 dates), and 2031-2032 (0.220297; 506 dates). Results are interpreted conservatively given the 15-instrument cross-section.",
